e, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DV2qCxOC", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "其实就是价值观的一致性，然而也只能达到小部分一致，人的思想太复杂了h", "bookVersion": 2058600183, "range": "1510-1588", "abstract": "按照企业文化理论奠基人之一埃德加·沙因教授的观点，“文化是一个集体在其整个历史中习得的所有共享的被视为理所当然的假设的总和”，即文化是共同习得和默认的假设。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 49, "reviewId": "17408780_7DV2qCxOC", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668963547, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 49, "chapterTitle": "形态背后的文化", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DRgx2tqn", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "资源重复是一种成本，当可获取的利益大于成本时，是可以投入的，关键问题是如何衡量？", "bookVersion": 2058600183, "range": "857-969", "abstract": "但反过来看，但凡有资源共享的地方，就会影响到责任边界，即责任是不完整的。每个人都有责任，恰恰就意味着每个人都没责任，责任一定会被推诿。从这个意义上，事业部制是以资源的重复配置为代价，换来了责任主体的明确，使整个事业部被激活。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 36, "reviewId": "17408780_7DRgx2tqn", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668749267, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 36, "chapterTitle": "三、以结果为中心的组织设计", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DNiQJkkQ", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "百度的GTM组织就是形同虚设，有责无权。", "bookVersion": 102125664, "range": "11899-12005", "abstract": "有的跨部门机制是有价值的，但有的本可以避免。越是在那些管理不健全的企业中，跨部门的协调与沟通越多，但往往又总是议而不决。除了流程上的问题，最经常的原因还是责权利匹配不到位，诸如责任不明确、权力不充分、激励后置等。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 25, "reviewId": "17408780_7DNiQJkkQ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668524190, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 25, "chapterTitle": "基于整体协同构建流程闭环", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DNilei9d", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "即使在云计算这种讲究规模效益的商业模式下，依然出现大量的以产定销，产研能开发出什么服务就卖什么服务，而产研开发的是否符合销售侧是个问题。", "bookVersion": 102125664, "range": "3498-3588", "abstract": "常有企业拿出“以产定销”的办法，即有多少产品就卖多少，卖光就好，但其实这并不是解决问题的办法，只能算没有办法的办法，是在以“买方的不满”置换“卖方的满意”，短期可行，但长期行不通。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 25, "reviewId": "17408780_7DNilei9d", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668523724, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 25, "chapterTitle": "基于整体协同构建流程闭环", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DNi2IEES", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "避免库存积压，供销平衡", "bookVersion": 102125664, "range": "1710-1844", "abstract": "像以色列学者高德拉特在《目标》一书中谈到的，“平衡的工厂（balanced plant）是整个西方世界的工厂长久以来致力追求的目标，在平衡的工厂中，每一种资源的产能都能和市场需求达到完全的均衡”。在高德拉特看来，企业家真正需要建立的是“流量思维”，而不是“产量思维”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 25, "reviewId": "17408780_7DNi2IEES", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668523451, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 25, "chapterTitle": "基于整体协同构建流程闭环", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7DNh0MwUf", "review": {"bookId": "35276982", "content": "页财一体化的终极目标。", "bookVersion": 102125664, "range": "2543-2739", "abstract": "现在由于技术的进步，各种新概念频出，但是做管理改善不能概念先行、一味追新，还是得现实导向，解决实际问题。就像台塑集团早在2000年就做到了“一日结算”，指的是每月月底、每年年底对财务数据和经营数据做汇总分析，次月一日结清，包括财务报表、异常管理、考核结果、改善建议等。王永庆先生说，“做到‘一日结算’是一个公司管理制度走上轨道的标志”。这句话放到今天依然管用，有多少企业能做到“一日结算”呢？", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 22, "reviewId": "17408780_7DNh0MwUf", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1668522506, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "35276982", "format": "epub", "version": 691920526, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/60/YueWen_35276982/s_YueWen_35276982.jpg", "title": "组织的逻辑", "author": "丛龙峰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 22, "chapterTitle": "流程管理的四项原则", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 7}}